  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. Since <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> yard is equal to <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math> feet, <math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math> yards is equal to <math alttext=\"64 yards left parenthesis StartFraction 3 feet Over 1 yard EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mn>64</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>yards</mtext><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>feet</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>yard</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"192\"><mn>192</mn>\n</math> feet. It follows that <math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math> yards per second is equivalent to <math alttext=\"192\"><mn>192</mn>\n</math> feet per second. Therefore, the object's speed is <math alttext=\"192\"><mn>192</mn>\n</math> feet per second.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. A speed of <math alttext=\"61\"><mn>61</mn>\n</math> feet per second is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"StartFraction 61 Over 3 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>61</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, not <math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math>, yards per second.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. A speed of <math alttext=\"67\"><mn>67</mn>\n</math> feet per second is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"StartFraction 67 Over 3 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>67</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, not <math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math>, yards per second.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. A speed of <math alttext=\"94\"><mn>94</mn>\n</math> feet per second is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"StartFraction 94 Over 3 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>94</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, not <math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math>, yards per second.</p>",
